00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:29.281
The movie opens with a snippet of The Warrens
investigating the Amityville Haunting, and

00:02:29.281 --> 00:02:33.310
as Lorraine has her out of body experience,
you can spot a Nun painting on the bedroom

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:34.310
